	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Image Clipper – Alfred Workflow

Browse images from a specified directory and copy the selected one to your clipboard as PNG.

Setup:
1. Set the IMG_DIR workflow variable to point to your image directory (default: ~/imageclipper)
2. Trigger with keyword "img"
3. Select an image to copy it to your clipboard</string>
